    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.74,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the National TransportCommission (Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.94,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 40 of the National Transport CommissionAct, No. 37 of 1991 is hereby amended by the substitutionfor the words \u201cnot exceeding ten thousand rupees\u201d of thewords \u201cnot exceeding two hundered thousand rupees\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      394.97,
      401.9,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
